{"seconds": 37.2, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! After **1. Rb8 Rc1+ 2. Kh2 Qxb8 3. Rxf8+ Kh7**, White is winning decisively with extra material (rook for nothing, threatening f7 pawn and controlling the 8th rank).\n\n**The move is Rb8!** This is a quiet move that threatens an unstoppable back-rank mating pattern (Rxf8#), forcing Black's queen to be captured.\n\n---\n\n**Coaching Note:**\n\nWhen a king retreats to the back rank with limited escape squares, look for rook moves to the 8th rank threatening mate. Here, Rb8 threatens unstoppable Rxf8#\u2014Black's queen must come back to defend, but after forcing White's king to move with checks, Black loses the queen. The lesson: back-rank weakness + a threatening piece are often winning; sometimes the quiet move is stronger than captures.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Rb8\", \"line\": [\"Rb8\", \"Rc1+\", \"Kh2\", \"Qxb8\", \"Rxf8+\", \"Kh7\"], \"motifs\": [\"backRankMate\", \"quietMove\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pFp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41", "square": "e7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41", "square": "b7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41", "square": "f8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41", "square": "g8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2p/8/7P/2r3P1/7K w - - 4 41", "square": "b8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "5qk1/1R2Qp2/4pPp1/p3P2